## Using the library

The tool is a thin shell over `{{ name }}-core`, which is published on its own:

```console
$ cargo add {{ name }}-core
```

```rust
use {{ lib_name }}_core::greet;

fn main() -> Result<(), {{ lib_name }}_core::Error> {
    println!("{}", greet("world")?);
    Ok(())
}
```

The reference is on [docs.rs](https://docs.rs/{{ name }}-core).

